onboarding.metrics.desc:
Enables typing metrics collection.

What ErgoptiPlus tracks:
• typing speed (WPM) per session, per app and over time;
• most-typed keys, words, n-grams and ergonomic strain;
• hand alternation, finger load, same-finger bigrams;
• time spent per application (RescueTime-style) with productivity scoring;
• trends, heatmaps and detailed dashboards in the Metrics window.

